
### Read List
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v2/method/frappe.client.get_list
Authorization: token {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
	"doctype": "Job Estimate",
	"filters": [ ],
	"order_by": "creation desc",
	"fields": [
		"name",
		"job_type",
		"job_id",
		"date",
		"creation",
		"item_name",
		"supplier.supplier_name",
		"price"
	]
}



